  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CIVIT- Strengthening the Operational Capacities of Relevant Ivorian Authorities for Migration and Border Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to ensure more effective control of cross-border movements in C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire while strengthening the capacity of border management authorities to address current transnational threats and strengthen international cooperation in migration management in C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire. The project will focus on infrastructural improvement of land borders through the construction and equipping of four (4) border posts in strategic sites to be identified jointly with the DST to ensure more effective control of cross-border land movements. Additionally the project will focus on the strengthening of the technical and operational capacities of the Ivorian government authorities involved in the safeguarding of national security and the fight against transnational crimes such as trafficking in human beings, smuggling of migrants and terrorism. Lastly, the project will focus on cross-border cooperation, for the purposes of prevention and repression of irregular migration and illicit trafficking, through the organization of meetings between the representatives of the competent authorities of the Republic of C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire and the bordering countries.</narrative>
  </description>
